{"availability":"available","full":"pascal029/youdontknowllm","name":"youdontknowllm","description":"A platform for learning what's actually happen in app LLM.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T03:49:11Z","updated":"2026-10-08T03:52:59Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://youdontknowllm.netlify.app/","topics":["llm"],"demo":"https://youdontknowllm.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:13.609Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:13.609Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:13.609Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:13.609Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Learn how LLMs actually work: in your browser, step by step.","Chat with a small language model running entirely on your own GPU (no server, no account), or plug in any OpenAI-compatible API. Then look inside: edit the system prompt, give the model tools, and watch every step of the agent loop, the context window filling up and the tokens/sec."],"features":["Or bring your own API: any OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint (OpenAI, Ollama, LM Studio, vLLM, OpenRouter…).","Editable system prompt: change the persona and see the answers change. The full prompt (system + tool instructions) is shown read-only so nothing is hidden.","Function calling: 5 ready tools (calculator, getcurrenttime, randomnumber, runjavascript, wikipediasearch) plus your own custom tools (JSON Schema + JavaScript), with a Test run button.","Sandboxed tools: tool code runs in a throwaway Web Worker with a 3s timeout. It has no DOM, no access to your API key, and no access to the model cache.","Step-by-step timeline: your prompt → model output → tool chosen + arguments → tool result → final answer, with raw events and highlighted errors."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pascal029/youdontknowllm/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5c64eac7e0b7559d5e32a8b135ed155498eecd17071025279